Alfa Romeo C42 3D model (geometry only)

Source: https://github.com/markste-in/c42
File used: c42.glb (high-poly; the upstream c42.stl is a low-poly preview).
Vendored here as an oriented binary STL (`c42.stl`) so the importer does not
re-axis the glTF Y-up scene.
Author: markste-in
Upstream license: WTFPL Version 2 (Do What The Fuck You Want To Public License)

The vendored mesh is rotated so the nose faces the tunnel inlet (−x) and
+y is up. No livery, textures, or trademarks are included.

WTFPL is a permissive, public-domain-equivalent license and is compatible
with this repository's MIT license.

